      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اخصمهُ</span></b>  <i>He dictated to him his plea against
his adversary in an altercation</i> or <i>a dispute</i> or
<i>litigation,</i> (JK, TA,) <i>whereby he might overcome
the latter.</i> (JK.)

